         <div type="bio">
            <p>Irish parliamentarian, economist, journalist, and soldier, killed in battle during the first World War. He and JJ knew each other while at University College. Kettle published a mixed review of <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Chamber Music</name> ([1 June 1907], 5). JJ incorporated some elements of Kettle into the character of Robert Hand in <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">Exiles</name>. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
         </div>
